\'d0-TTg ng\'e0y 28 th\'e1ng 12 n\'e3m 2011 c\u7911\'3fa Th\u7911\'3f t\'fd\u7899\'3fng Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f v\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp \'f0\u7863\'3fc th
