\'3fng d\u7883\'3fch (sau \'f0\'e2y g\u7885\'3fi t\u7855\'3ft l\'e0 Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 73/2011/Q\'d0-TTg) \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn nh\'fd sau:
\par 1. \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f kh\'e1m b\u7879\'3fnh, ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh l\'e0 b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn (k\u7875\'3f c\u7843\'3f b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn qu\'e2n d\'e2n y), trung t\'e2m y t\u7871\'3f qu\u7853\'3fn, huy
