\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 73/2011/Q\'d0-TTg.
\par 2. \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi ph}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f2ng kh\'e1m }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0a khoa khu v\u7921\'3fc, nh\'e0 h\u7897\'3f sinh:
\par a) Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp ph}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f2ng kh\'e1m }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0a khoa v\u7921\'3fc ho\u7863\'3fc nh\'e0 h\u7897\'3f sinh tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc S\u7903\'3f
 Y t\u7871\'3f: \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc nh\'e2n l\u7921\'3fc trong phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Kho\u7843\'3fn 5 \'d0i\u7873\'3fu n\'e0y;
\par b) Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp ph}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f2ng kh\'e1m }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0a khoa khu v\u7921\'3fc, nh\'e0 h\u7897\'3f sinh thu\u7897\'3fc b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn ho\u7863
\'3fc trung t\'e2m y t\u7871\'3f huy\u7879\'3fn: \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc nh\'e2n l\u7921\'3fc trong phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\'ednh chung cho c\u7843\'3f s\u7889\'3f gi\'fd\u7901\'3fng b\u7879\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh vi
\u7879\'3fn ho\u7863\'3fc trung t\'e2m y t\u7871\'3f huy\u7879\'3fn v\'e0 s\u7889\'3f gi\'fd\u7901\'3fng b\u7879\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c ph}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f2ng kh\'e1m }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 
\'f0a khoa khu v\u7921\'3fc, nh\'e0 h\u7897\'3f sinh tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc.
\par Gi\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn ho\u7863\'3fc Gi\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc trung t\'e2m y t\u7871\'3f huy\u7879\'3fn quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f nh\'e2n l\u7921\'3fc trong phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng ph
}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f2ng kh\'e1m }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0a khoa khu v\u7921\'3fc, nh\'e0 h\u7897\'3f sinh thu\u7897\'3fc th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn qu\u7843\'3fn l}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'fd tr\'ean }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 nguy\'ean t\u7855\'3fc b\u7843\'3fo \'f0\u7843\'3fm nh\'e2n l\u7921\'3fc cho ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng chuy\'ean m\'f4n v\'e0 ph\'f9 h\u7907
\'3fp v\u7899\'3fi ngu\u7891\'3fn t\'e0i ch\'ednh c\u7911\'3fa \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f.
\par 3. \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\'e0nh l\u7853\'3fp theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa ph\'e1p lu\u7853\'3ft v\u7873\'3f x\u7917\'3f l}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 
\'fd vi ph\u7841\'3fm h\'e0nh ch\'ednh v\'e0 c}{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f5 s\u7903\'3f \'f0i\u7873\'3fu d\'fd\u7905\'3fng th\'fd\'f5ng binh, b\u7879\'3fnh binh, ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi khuy\u7871\'3ft t\u7853\'3ft:
\par a) C\'f5 s\u7903\'3f h\u7841\'3fng I: t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a kh\'f4ng qu\'e1 24 ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi/phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc;
\par b) C\'f5 s\u7903\'3f h\u7841\'3fng II: t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a kh\'f4ng qu\'e1 16 ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi/phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc;
