\par 4. \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi tr\u7841\'3fm y t\u7871\'3f x}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'e3, ph}{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'fd\u7901\'3fng, th\u7883\'3f tr\u7845\'3fn, tr\u7841\'3fm y t\u7871\'3f qu\'e2n d\'e2
n y (sau \'f0\'e2y g\u7885\'3fi t\u7855\'3ft l\'e0 tr\u7841\'3fm}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098  y t\u7871\'3f x\'e3): \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc nh\'e2n l\u7921\'3f
c trong phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'d0i\u7875\'3fm b Kho\u7843\'3fn 2 \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 2 c\u7911\'3fa Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 73/2011/Q\'d0-TTg.
\par S\u7903\'3f Y t\u7871\'3f c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o c\'e1c ti\'eau ch\'ed v\u7873\'3f: n\'e3ng l\u7921\'3fc chuy\'ean m\'f4n, s\u7889\'3f l\'fd\u7907\'3ft kh\'e1m b\u7879\'3fnh, ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh b}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 
\'ecnh qu\'e2n/ng\'e0y c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng tr\u7841\'3fm y t\u7871\'3f x\'e3; kho\u7843\'3fng c\'e1ch t\u7915\'3f tr\u7841\'3fm y t\u7871\'3f x\'e3 }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0\u7871\'3fn c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f kh\'e1m b\u7879
\'3fnh, ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh tuy\u7871\'3fn tr\'ean; \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ki\u7879\'3fn \'f0\u7883\'3fa l}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'fd, t\u7921\'3f nhi\'ean v\'e0 kh\u7843\'3f n}{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 
\'e3ng ng\'e2n s\'e1ch \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng \'f0\u7875\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f s\u7889\'3f l\'fd\u7907\'3fng nh\'e2n l\u7921\'3fc trong phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi t\u7915\'3fng tr\u7841\'3fm y t
\u7871\'3f x}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'e3 do }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'fd.
\par }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp trong phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc c\'f3 ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi b\u7879\'3fnh ph\u7843\'3fi c\u7845\'3fp c\u7913\'3fu, c\u7847\'3fn ph\u7843\'3fi c\'f3 c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f y t\u7871\'3f
 \'f0i c\'f9ng \'f0\u7875\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi b\u7879\'3fnh l\'ean tuy\u7871\'3fn tr\'ean ho\u7863\'3fc tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c\'f3 s\u7921\'3f c\u7889\'3f x\u7843\'3fy ra d\u7851\'3fn \'f0\u7871\'3fn s\u7889\'3f ng\'fd\u7901
\'3fi tr\u7921\'3fc theo \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc kh\'f4ng b\u7843\'3fo \'f0\u7843\'3fm \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu chuy\'ean m\'f4n, Tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng tr\u7841\'3fm y t\u7871\'3f x}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'e3 }{
\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7917\'3f ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi l\'e0m th\'eam gi\u7901\'3f, th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn tr\u7843\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn l\'fd\'f5ng l\'e0m \'f0\'eam v\'e0 l\'e0
m th\'eam gi\u7901\'3f theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa ph\'e1p lu\u7853\'3ft.
\par 5. \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c b\u7879\'3fnh x\'e1, ph}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f2ng kh\'e1m qu\'e2n d\'e2n y \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc nh\'e2n l
\u7921\'3fc trong phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc nh\'fd sau:
\par a) Quy m\'f4 d\'fd\u7899\'3fi 10 gi\'fd\u7901\'3fng b\u7879\'3fnh: 02 ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi/phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc;
\par b) Quy m\'f4 t\u7915\'3f 10 gi\'fd\u7901\'3fng b\u7879\'3fnh \'f0\u7871\'3fn d\'fd\u7899\'3fi 20 gi\'fd\u7901\'3fng b\u7879\'3fnh: 03 ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi/phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc;
\par c) Quy m\'f4 t\u7915\'3f 20 gi\'fd\u7901\'3fng b\u7879\'3fnh tr\u7903\'3f l\'ean: 05 ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi/phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc.
\par 6. \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f kh\'e1m b\u7879\'3fnh, ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh kh\'f4ng thu\u7897\'3fc m\u7897\'3ft trong c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn 1, 2, 3, 4 v\'e0
 5 \'d0i\u7873\'3fu n\'e0y: \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc nh\'e2n l\u7921\'3fc trong phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn h\u7841\'3fng IV v\'e0 b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn ch\'fda \'f0\'fd
\u7907\'3fc x\u7871\'3fp h\u7841\'3fng quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'d0i\u7875\'3fm a Kho\u7843\'3fn 2 \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 2 c\u7911\'3fa Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 73/2011/Q\'d0-TTg.
\par }{\b\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 2. M\u7913\'3fc ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\'e0nh l\u7853\'3fp theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c
\u7911\'3fa ph\'e1p lu\u7853\'3ft v\u7873\'3f x\u7917\'3f l}{\b\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'fd vi ph\u7841\'3fm h\'e0nh ch}{\b\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'ednh v\'e0 c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f \'f0i\u7873\'3fu d\'fd\u7905
\'3fng th\'fd\'f5ng binh, b\u7879\'3fnh binh, ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi khuy\u7871\'3ft t\u7853\'3ft}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 
\par }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 1. M\u7913\'3fc ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp th\'fd\u7901\'3fng tr\u7921\'3fc ng\'e0y th\'fd\u7901\'3fng, g\u7891\'3fm c\'e1c m\u7913\'3fc sau:
\par a) M\u7913\'3fc ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp th\'fd\u7901\'3fng tr\u7921\'3fc t\u7841\'3fi c\'e1c khu v\u7921\'3fc th\'f4ng th\'fd\u7901\'3fng:
\par - 90.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng/ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi/phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc x\u7871\'3fp h\u7841\'3fng I;
\par - 65.000\'f0\u7891\'3fng/ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi/phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc x\u7871\'3fp h\u7841\'3fng II v\'e0 h\u7841\'3fng III.
\par b) M\u7913\'3fc ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp th\'fd\u7901\'3fng tr\u7921\'3fc t\u7841\'3fi khu v\u7921\'3fc \'f0i\u7873\'3fu tr\u7883\'3f c\u7855\'3ft c\'f5n, gi\u7843\'3fi \'f0\u7897\'3fc v\'e0 ph\u7909\'3fc h\u7891\'3fi s\u7913\'3fc kho\u7867\'3f ho\u7863
\'3fc khu v\u7921\'3fc c\'e1ch ly b\u7879\'3fnh truy\u7873\'3fn nhi\u7877\'3fm b\u7857\'3fng 1,5 l\u7847\'3fn m\u7913\'3fc ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'d0i\u7875\'3fm a Kho\u7843\'3fn n\'e0y.
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 2. M\u7913\'3fc ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 th\'fd\u7901\'3fng tr\u7921\'3fc v\'e0o ng\'e0y ngh\u7881\'3f ti\'eau chu\u7849\'3fn h\u7857\'3fng tu\u7847\'3f
n, ng\'e0y l\u7877\'3f, ng\'e0y t\u7871\'3ft v\'e0 m\u7913\'3fc h\u7895\'3f tr\u7907\'3f ti\u7873\'3fn \'e3n trong phi\'ean tr\u7921\'3fc 24/24 gi\u7901\'3f: th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Kho\u7843\'3fn 3 \'d0i\u7873
\'3fu 3 Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 73/2011/Q\'d0-TTg.
\par }{\b\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 3. Ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp ch\u7889\'3fng d\u7883\'3fch \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp tham gia kh\'e1m, ch
\u7849\'3fn \'f0o\'e1n, \'f0i\u7873\'3fu tr\u7883\'3f t\u7841\'3fi c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f kh\'e1m b\u7879\'3fnh, ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh truy\u7873\'3fn nhi\u7877\'3fm}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 
\par }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 1. Ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp tham gia kh\'e1m, ch\u7849\'3fn \'f0o\'e1n, \'f0i\u7873\'3fu tr\u7883\'3f ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi m\u7855\'3fc b\u7879\'3fnh d\u7883\'3fch t\u7841\'3fi c\'f5 s
\u7903\'3f kh\'e1m b\u7879\'3fnh, ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh truy\u7873\'3fn nhi\u7877\'3fm \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903\'3fng ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp ch\u7889\'3fng d\u7883\'3fch theo m\u7913\'3fc quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Kho\u7843\'3fn 1 
\'d0i\u7873\'3fu 3 Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 73/2011/Q\'d0-TTg.
\par 2. Danh m\u7909\'3fc c\'e1c b\u7879\'3fnh truy\u7873\'3fn nhi\u7877\'3fm nh\'f3m B m\'e0 ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp tham gia kh\'e1m, ch\u7849\'3fn \'f0o\'e1n, \'f0i\u7873\'3fu tr\u7883\'3f t\u7841\'3fi c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f kh\'e1m b\u7879
\'3fnh, ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh truy\u7873\'3fn nhi\u7877\'3fm \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903\'3fng ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp ch\u7889\'3fng d\u7883\'3fch t\u7841\'3fi Ph\u7909\'3f l\u7909\'3fc 1 ban h\'e0nh k\'e8m theo Th
\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y.
\par C\'e3n c}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \u7913\'3f v\'e0o t\'ecnh h\'ecnh th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f, m\u7913\'3fc }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0\u7897\'3f nguy hi\u7875\'3fm, ph\u7913\'3fc t\u7841\'3fp c\u7911\'3f
a d\u7883\'3fch b\u7879\'3fnh, B\u7897\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng B\u7897\'3f Y t\u7871\'3f xem x\'e9t, quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7909\'3f th\u7875\'3f danh m\u7909\'3fc c\'e1c b\u7879\'3fnh truy\u7873\'3fn nhi\u7877\'3fm thu\u7897\'3fc nh\'f3m B ngo
\'e0i danh m\u7909\'3fc quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Ph\u7909\'3f l\u7909\'3fc 1 ban h\'e0nh k\'e8m theo Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y v\'e0 danh m\u7909\'3fc c\'e1c b\u7879\'3fnh truy\u7873\'3fn nhi\u7877\'3fm thu\u7897\'3fc nh\'f3m C theo quy \'f0\u7883
\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 3 c\u7911\'3fa Lu\u7853\'3ft ph}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f2ng, ch\u7889\'3fng b\u7879\'3fnh truy\u7873\'3fn nhi\u7877\'3fm m\'e0 ng}{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'fd\u7901
\'3fi tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp tham gia kh\'e1m, ch\u7849\'3fn \'f0o\'e1n, \'f0i\u7873\'3fu tr\u7883\'3f t\u7841\'3fi c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f kh\'e1m b\u7879\'3fnh, ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh truy\u7873\'3fn nhi\u7877\'3fm \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903
\'3fng ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp ch\u7889\'3fng d\u7883\'3fch theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y.
\par 3. C\'f5 s\u7903\'3f kh\'e1m b\u7879\'3fnh, ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh truy\u7873\'3fn nhi\u7877\'3fm g\u7891\'3fm: b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn chuy\'ean khoa b\u7879\'3fnh truy\u7873\'3fn nhi\u7877\'3fm; khoa truy\u7873\'3fn nhi\u7877\'3fm thu\u7897\'3f
c b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn \'f0a khoa qu\u7853\'3fn, huy\u7879\'3fn, th\u7883\'3f x}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'e3, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f thu\u7897\'3fc t\u7881\'3fnh tr\u7903\'3f l\'ean v\'e0 c\'e1c c}{
\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f5 s\u7903\'3f y t\u7871\'3f kh\'e1c c\'f3 nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7909\'3f kh\'e1m b\u7879\'3fnh, ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh truy\u7873\'3fn nhi\u7877\'3fm \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc Ban Ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\u7841\'3f
o ch\u7889\'3fng d\u7883\'3fch c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh huy \'f0\u7897\'3fng trong tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c\'f3 d\u7883\'3fch.
\par 4. Th\u7901\'3fi gian h\'fd\u7903\'3fng ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp ch\u7889\'3fng d\u7883\'3fch l\'e0 s\u7889\'3f ng\'e0y th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f tham gia kh\'e1m, ch\u7849\'3fn \'f0o\'e1n, \'f0i\u7873\'3fu tr\u7883\'3f ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi m\u7855\'3fc b
\u7879\'3fnh truy\u7873\'3fn nhi\u7877\'3fm quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Ph\u7909\'3f l\u7909\'3fc 1 ban h\'e0nh k\'e8m theo Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y t\u7841\'3fi c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f kh\'e1m b\u7879\'3fnh, ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh truy\u7873\'3fn nhi
\u7877\'3fm, trong th\u7901\'3fi gian k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f ng\'e0y c\'f5 quan c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn c\'f4ng b\u7889\'3f d\u7883\'3fch \'f0\u7871\'3fn khi c\'f4ng b\u7889\'3f h\u7871\'3ft d\u7883\'3fch.
\par }{\b\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 4. K\u7871\'3ft c\u7845\'3fu chi ph\'ed chi tr\u7843\'3f ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp \'f0\u7863\'3fc th\'f9 v\'e0o gi\'e1 d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f y t\u7871\'3f}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 
\par }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 1. Chi ph\'ed chi tr\u7843\'3f ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp th\'fd\u7901\'3fng tr\u7921\'3fc (tr\u7915\'3f ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp th\'fd\u7901\'3fng tr\u7921\'3fc c\u7911\'3fa }{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 tr\u7841\'3fm y t\u7871\'3f x\'e3) }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\'ednh v\'e0o chi ph\'ed ng\'e0y gi\'fd\u7901\'3fng b\u7879\'3fnh, m\u7913\'3fc chi ph\'ed \'f0\'fd
\u7907\'3fc c\u7897\'3fng v\'e0o m\u7913\'3fc gi\'e1 ng\'e0y gi\'fd\u7901\'3fng b\u7879\'3fnh theo t\u7915\'3fng lo\u7841\'3fi b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn nh\'fd sau:
\par a) B\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn h\u7841\'3fng \'f0\u7863\'3fc bi\u7879\'3ft, h\u7841\'3fng I: t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a 20.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng;
\par b) B\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn h\u7841\'3fng II: t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a 15.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng;
\par }{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 c) B\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn h\u7841\'3fng I}{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 II: t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a 11.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng;
\par d) B\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn h\u7841\'3fng IV v\'e0 c\'e1c c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f kh\'e1m b\u7879\'3fnh, ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh ch\'fda \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc x\u7871\'3fp h\u7841\'3fng (tr\u7915\'3f tr\u7841\'3fm y t\u7871\'3f x}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'e3): t\u7889\'3fi }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0a 10.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng;
\par V\'ed d\u7909\'3f 1: B\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn A l\'e0 b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn h\u7841\'3fng I, m\u7913\'3fc gi\'e1 ng\'e0y gi\'fd\u7901\'3fng b\u7879\'3fnh \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'e3 }{
\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh cho b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn khi ch\'fda k\u7871\'3ft c\u7845\'3fu chi ph\'ed chi tr\u7843\'3f ph\u7909
\'3f c\u7845\'3fp th\'fd\u7901\'3fng tr\u7921\'3fc l\'e0 55.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng. N\u7871\'3fu c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc chi ph\'ed chi tr\u7843\'3f ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp th\'fd\u7901
\'3fng tr\u7921\'3fc cho c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi gi\'fd\u7901\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn h\u7841\'3fng I \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7897\'3fng v\'e0o m\u7913\'3fc gi\'e1 l\'e0 18.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng th}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'ec b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn }{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc thu c\u7911\'3fa ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi b\u7879\'3fnh ho\u7863\'3fc thanh to\'e1n v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 quan B
\u7843\'3fo hi\u7875\'3fm x}{\f0\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'e3 h\u7897\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi m\u7913\'3fc gi\'e1 ng\'e0y gi}{\f421\fs28\cf0\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'fd\u7901\'3fng b\u7879\'3fnh n\u7897\'3fi khoa l\'e0 55.000 \'f0
\u7891\'3fng + 18.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng = 73.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par 2. Chi ph\'ed chi tr\u7843\'3f ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp ph\u7851\'3fu thu\u7853\'3ft, th\u7911\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\'ednh v\'e0o chi ph\'ed c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng ph\u7851\'3fu thu\u7853\'3ft, th\u7911\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft, m\u7913
\'3fc chi ph\'ed \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7897\'3fng v\'e0o m\u7913\'3fc gi\'e1 c\u7911\'3fa t\u7915\'3fng lo\u7841\'3fi ph\u7851\'3fu thu\u7853\'3ft, th\u7911\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft nh\'fd sau:
\par a) Ph\u7851\'3fu thu\u7853\'3ft lo\u7841\'3fi \'f0\u7863\'3fc bi\u7879\'3ft: t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a 1.520.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng/ca;
\par }{\f413\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 b) Ph\u7851\'3fu thu\u7853\'3ft lo\u7841\'3fi I: t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a 660.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng/ca;
\par c) Ph\u7851\'3fu thu\u7853\'3ft lo\u7841\'3fi II: t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a 340.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng/ca;
\par d) Ph\u7851\'3fu thu\u7853\'3ft lo\u7841\'3fi III: t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a 190.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng/ca;
\par \'f0) Th\u7911\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft lo\u7841\'3fi \'d0\u7863\'3fc bi\u7879\'3ft: t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a 300.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng/ca;
\par e) Th\u7911\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft lo\u7841\'3fi I: t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a 144.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng/ca;
\par g) Th\u7911\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft lo\u7841\'3fi II: t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a 63.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng/ca;
\par h) Th\u7911\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft lo\u7841\'3fi III: t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a 28.500 \'f0\u7891\'3fng/ca;
\par }{\f421\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 V\'ed d\u7909\'3f 2: Ph\u7851\'3fu thu\u7853\'3ft A, theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f Y t\u7871\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ph\'e2n lo\u7841\'3fi I. M\u7913\'3f
c gi\'e1 c\u7911\'3fa ph\u7851\'3fu thu\u7853\'3ft n\'e0y \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh cho \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f, \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng khi ch\'fda k\u7871\'3ft c\u7845\'3f
u chi ph\'ed chi tr\u7843\'3f ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp ph\u7851\'3fu thu\u7853\'3ft, th\u7911\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft v\'e0o gi\'e1 l\'e0 3.500.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par N\u7871\'3fu c\u7845\'3fp c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc chi ph\'ed chi tr\u7843\'3f ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp ph\u7851\'3fu thu\u7853\'3ft \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\u7897\'3fng v\'e0o m\u7913\'3fc gi\'e1 c
\u7911\'3fa ph\u7851\'3fu thu\u7853\'3ft lo\u7841\'3fi I l\'e0 600.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng th}{\f0\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'ec b\u7879\'3fnh vi\u7879\'3fn }{
\f421\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc thu c\u7911\'3fa ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi b\u7879\'3fnh ho\u7863\'3fc thanh to\'e1n v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 quan B\u7843\'3fo hi\u7875\'3fm x}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'e3 h\u7897\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi m\u7913\'3fc gi\'e1 l\'e0 3.500.000 }{\f413\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0\u7891\'3fng + 600.000 
\'f0\u7891\'3fng = 4.100.000 \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par }{\f421\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 3. Th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc chi ph\'ed chi tr\u7843\'3f ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp th\'fd\u7901\'3fng tr\u7921\'3fc, ph}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp ph\u7851\'3fu thu\u7853\'3ft, th\u7911\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft v\'e0o gi\'e1 d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f y t\u7871\'3f:
\par }{\f421\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 a) \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f kh\'e1m b\u7879\'3fnh, ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh thu\u7897\'3fc B\u7897\'3f Y t\u7871\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn l}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'fd: do B\u7897\'3f tr}{\f421\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'fd\u7903\'3fng B\u7897\'3f Y t\u7871\'3f quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3f
nh;
\par b) \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f kh\'e1m b\u7879\'3fnh, ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh thu\u7897\'3fc c\'e1c B\u7897\'3f, c\'f5 quan ngang B\u7897\'3f, c\'f5 quan thu\u7897\'3fc Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn l}{
