\par c) \u7910\'3fy ban nh\'e2n d\'e2n t\u7881\'3fnh, c\'e1c B\u7897\'3f, c\'f5 quan ngang B\u7897\'3f, c\'f5 quan thu\u7897\'3fc Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp, l\u7853\'3fp b\'e1o c\'e1o theo Ph\u7909\'3f l\u7909\'3fc s\u7889\'3f 3,4 v\'e0
