\b\f0\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 . Hi\u7879\'3fu l\u7921\'3fc thi h\'e0nh}{\f0\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 
\par }{\f421\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 1. Th\'f4ng t\'fd li\'ean t\u7883\'3fch n\'e0y c\'f3 hi\u7879\'3fu l\u7921\'3fc thi h\'e0nh k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f ng\'e0y 05 th\'e1ng 5 n\'e3m 2014.
\par Th\'f4ng t\'fd li\'ean t\u7883\'3fch s\u7889\'3f 09/2003/TTLT-BYT-BNV-BTC ng\'e0y 29 th\'e1ng 9 n\'e3m 2003 c\u7911\'3fa li\'ean t\u7883\'3fch B\u7897\'3f Y t\u7871\'3f, B\u7897\'3f N\u7897\'3fi v\u7909\'3f, B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d
\u7851\'3fn th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh s\u7889\'3f 155/2003/Q\'d0-TTg ng\'e0y 30 th\'e1ng 7 n\'e3m 2003 c\u7911\'3fa Th\u7911\'3f t\'fd\u7899\'3fng Ch\'ednh ph\u7911\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f ph
\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp \'fdu \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'e3i theo ngh\u7873\'3f }{\f421\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1
n b\u7897\'3f, vi\'ean ch\u7913\'3fc c\'f4ng t\'e1c t\u7841\'3fi c\'e1c c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f y t\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 Th\'f4ng t\'fd li\'ean t\u7883\'3fch s\u7889\'3f 18/2004/TTLT-BL\'d0TBXH-BYT-BTC ng\'e0y 22 th\'e1ng 11 n
\'e3m 2004 c\u7911\'3fa B\u7897\'3f Lao \'f0\u7897\'3fng - Th\'fd\'f5ng binh v\'e0 X}{\f0\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'e3 h\u7897\'3fi, B\u7897\'3f Y t\u7871\'3f v\'e0 B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh h}{
\f421\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f \'f0\u7863\'3fc th\'f9 \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1n b
\u7897\'3f l\'e0m vi\u7879\'3fc t\u7841\'3fi c\'e1c c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f ch\u7919\'3fa b\u7879\'3fnh \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\'e0nh l\u7853\'3fp theo ph\'e1p l\u7879\'3fnh x\u7917\'3f l}{
\f0\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098 \'fd vi ph\u7841\'3fm h\'e0nh ch\'ednh h\u7871\'3ft hi\u7879\'3fu l\u7921\'3fc k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f ng\'e0y}{
\f421\fs28\cf0\lang1033\langfe1066\langnp1033\insrsid11740086\charrsid12668098  Th\'f4ng t\'fd li\'ean t\u7883\'3fch n\'e0y c\'f3 hi\u7879\'3fu l\u7921\'3fc.
\par 2. Ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f ph\u7909\'3f c\u7845\'3fp \'f0\u7863\'3fc th\'f9 quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Th\'f4ng t\'fd li\'ean t\u7883\'3fch n\'e0y \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\'ednh h\'fd\u7903\'3fng k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f ng\'e0y 15 th\'e1ng 02 n
